Restrictions:

There are very few. This is Zeus Freeware. Copyright and all that
mumbo-jumbo remains with me, but the program is freely
distributable to Zeus Sysops only.

I hereby also give Alex and Nick the right to include this
program and data files etc in the official Zeus Distribution
when it gets released, and into the Demo version, should they
so wish.

The only thing I insist is that the default first entry on the
Zwall when it is reset is left as is with no changes at all.
That's where I plug myself as being the mad author etc.. Anyone
changing that does not have my permision to run this program on
their BBS End of story.

If you decide to hack out bits of this program and try and
credit it to yourself then you're damn sad, and I'll come round
and throw peanuts at you.. If you convert it to run on another
Bulletin board system, then I'd appreciate a credit on the new
version etc...

